<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX falls in very quiet trading.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX falls in very quiet trading.</headline>
<text>
<p>1048 GMT - The Czech RPIX index falls in quiet trading at mid-session on the Prague bourse.</p>
<p>*  .RPIX drops 3.3 points, 0.32 percent, to 1,025.5.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 5.1 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni Banka down five crowns to 1,600.</p>
<p>* Chemopetrol down six crowns to 1,203.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom off 38 crowns to 3,630.</p>
<p>* Skoda Plzen drops five crowns to 975.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
